ent-ActionMoonlightRotorcraftToggle = activate flight
    .desc = Start the engine or land with the rotor running. During descent, abort landing; after touchdown, stop the rotor.

ent-ActionMoonlightRotorcraftUp = ascend
    .desc = Lift off or abort landing, or select the Z-level above while airborne.

ent-ActionMoonlightRotorcraftDown = descend
    .desc = Land on the floor beneath the vehicle, or select the lower Z-level over open space.
